            "review_title": "Review at Indochine Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Hoa T\n12 contributions\n0\nTimeless elegance in Nha Trang\nJun 2023 • Friends\nLocated on the fifth floor in Potique Hotel in the center of Nha Trang city and only opened on weekend evenings, this fine dining restaurant is very elegance, Indochine style design and delicious food and friendly staff.\nWritten June 13, 2023\nMKT\nDear Hoa T,\n\nThank you very much for your kind review. We are really happly to know that you enjoyed our services. We do hope to welcoming you back to our restaurant soon.\n\nWish you all the best.\n\nBest regards,\nIndochine restaurant team\nRead more\nWritten June 17, 2023\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
