            "review_title": "Review at Indochine Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Trần R\n11 contributions\n0\nCome and try it\nMay 2023 • Friends\nGrilled French Chicken Drum stick is a must try here, and I was completely satisfied with it, and it only cost 150.000VNd/pax for a 5 star service at 5 Star hotel, what are you waiting for...? Come and try it\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten June 13, 2023\nMKT\nDear tr_nr2023,\n\nThank you very much for your review. We are really glad to know that you enjoyed our services. Apart from French grilled chicken leg, our Indochine restaurant offers various choices of cuisines and finest wine. We do hope to welcoming you back to our restaurant to enjoy more.\n\nWish you all the best.\n\nBest regards,\nIndochine restaurant team\nRead more\nWritten June 17, 2023\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
